        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Imperial USA DL-DB251KW-US32D, ADA Compliant Kwikset Key Door Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe ADA Compliant Deadbolt features a 5-pin Kwikset keyway so you know it is both secure, and easy to have keyed to match your existing Kwikset locks. This ADA Compliant Handicap Door Lock meets ANSI grade 3 requirements. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 2\" thick with backsets of 2-3/8” or 2-3/4″. For residential and light duty commercial applications.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis deadbolt also available: <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-deadbolt-imperial-usa-dl-db251\"><b>Schlage Key Lock</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DL-DB251KW-US32D Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.2 grade 3 requirements.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable 2-3/8” or 2-3/4″</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>1/4″ Heavy Gauge Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: 5 pin solid brass Kwikset keyway standard.</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed and reversible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
